@baseUrl = http://localhost:63839

### Available taxonomy, valid profile/ingredient slugs, shades and finishes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/filters

### Counts for products, variants, availability and domains
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/stats

### Curly hair products under 1,500,000 RIAL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products?domain=hair&hairType=hair-curly&maxPrice=1500000&page=1&pageSize=20

### Skin products with fragrance and shea excluded
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products?domain=skin&fragranceFree=true&excludeIngredientSlugs=fragrance&excludeIngredientSlugs=shea

### A product's complete active variants, including sold-out variants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products/4

### Background index readiness and progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/status

### Database/index readiness (503 until initial indexing succeeds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Low-budget skin consultation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consultation/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "برای پوست خشک یک کرم مرطوب‌کننده ارزان می‌خواهم",
  "domain": "skin",
  "skinType": "skin-dry",
  "maxPrice": 200000
}

### Hair consultation with explicit ingredient exclusion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consultation/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "برای موی فر و وز یک کرم مو بدون آبکشی می‌خواهم",
  "domain": "hair",
  "hairType": "hair-curly",
  "categorySlug": "leave-in",
  "excludeIngredientSlugs": ["fragrance"],
  "maxPrice": 1800000
}

### Beauty consultation constrained by color, finish and budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consultation/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "یک رژ لب صورتی مات می‌خواهم",
  "domain": "beauty",
  "categorySlug": "lipstick",
  "shade": "صورتی",
  "finish": "مات",
  "maxPrice": 2000000
}
